></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span> 暑期学校内容 </span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><span><span><span>    </span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1）</span></span></span><span><span><span>时间安排：</span></span></span><span><span>7月22-25日</span></span><span><span>；</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><span>   <span>（</span></span><span><span>2）</span></span><span><span>活动内容</span></span><span><span>：</span>开幕仪式、学术交流、学校参观</span><span>、</span><span>企业参访等环节</span><span>。</span><span><br/></span></section><section><span>   <span>（</span></span><span><span>3）</span></span><span><span>活动费用：</span></span><span>①由主办方统一安排食宿；②暑期学校以线上+线下结合的方式举行，学院将为异地的暑期学校学员提供在校的食宿，并给予1000元以内的来回路费报销额度（仅限高铁二等票、汽车票）；③由主办方安排的集体学习或考察活动均免费。</span><span>注意：活动安排以最终公布为准，请大家持续关注；学员须按要求全程准时参加活动。</span></section><section><span>   <span>（</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>暑期学校咨询</span></span><span><span>QQ群：</span></span><span>824396727</span></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>肆</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span> 报名方式 </span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>有意向申请的同学须在暑期学校报名系统（6月12日开放）</span><span>http://ehall.szu.edu.cn/yz/ybm报名，并按系统要求提交本人以下各项材料：</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>1）身份证正反面扫描件或者照片；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>2）学生证扫描件或者照片；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>3）包含所修全部课程的正式成绩单（院系或教务处加盖公章）；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>4）英语水平证明材料（四、六级英语证书，托福、雅思等成绩证明）；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>5）其他能够体现本人学习及科研能力的证明材料（各类获奖证书、代表性的学术论文首页、专利授权证明等）。</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>网上申请截止时间：</span><span>7月</span><span>5</span><span>日</span><span>（</span><span>暂定</span><span>）</span><span>，届时将视情况而定是否延期。我院收到申请后，将于<span>7月7日-9日</span>通过<span>邮件及短信</span>的方式通知参加的学生。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><span><br/></span></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>伍</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span> 联系我们 </span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>联系电话：</span><span>0755-26534421</span></p><p><span>邮箱：</span><span>zy2696@szu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>学院导师简介：</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>https://chem.szu.edu.cn/yjspy/zyjs.htm</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><span><br/></span></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>陆</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span> 学院简介 </span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icwEjM6J0OibGCaRj8X9DHs7y0iaKH2sibfyTpHggjcCxy8TqpR6jh0M6G4Y76v81TZnuLo3K7aXqgibP4Loiat3jpBffa4wESaEUZibIOhxqzO2UA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><span><span>近年来，学院以人才引进、学科建设、科学研究、人才培养为抓手，促进学院快速发展，现已取得以下成果：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>现有化学一级学科博士学位点、食品科学与工程一级学科</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>博</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>士学位点、食品科学与工程一级学科硕士学位点、化学工程专业学位硕士点</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>环境工程专业学位硕士点</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>以及食品与营养专业学位硕士点</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><ul><li><p><span><span>化学ESI全球排名</span></span><span><strong><span><span>前0.33‰</span></span></strong></span><span><span>，环境科学/生态学ESI全球排名</span></span><strong><span><span>前1.53‰</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>，</span></span></strong><span><span>农业科学学科排名</span></span><strong><span><span>前2.33‰</span></span></strong><span><span>；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>2025软科世界一流学科：化学专业全国</span></span><strong><span><span>第19名</span></span></strong><span><span>，化学工程全国</span></span><strong><span><span>第31名</span></span></strong><span><span>，食品科学与工程全国</span></span><strong><span><span>第39名</span></span></strong><span><span>；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>2025USNews世界大学学科：化学专业全国</span></span><strong><span><span>第18名</span></span></strong><span><span>，化学工程全国</span></span><strong><span><span>第21名</span></span></strong><span><span>，环境工程全国</span></span><strong><span><span>第21名</span></span></strong><span><span>；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>拥有</span></span><strong><span><span>4个</span></span></strong><span><span>省级教学科研平台，6个市级实验室，2个校企联合科技机构，8个校级研究中心；科研仪器设备总价值</span></span><strong><span><span>2亿</span></span></strong><span><span>多元；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>近五年来，获批国家级基金项目</span></span><strong><span><span>154</span></span></strong><span><span>项，省级基金项目</span></span><strong><span><span>110</span></span></strong><span><span>项，市基金</span></span><strong><span><span>128</span></span></strong><span><span>项，到账经费</span></span><strong><span><span>近3亿元</span></span></strong><span><span>；</span></span></p><p><span><span>组建了一支实力雄厚、教学经验丰富的师资队伍。现有教职员工150人，其中专任教师122人，包括教授38人、副教授47人；博士生导师73人，硕士生导师102人。专任教师中国家级人才</span></span><strong><span><span>18人</span></span></strong><span><span>，包括中国科学院院士</span></span><strong><span><span>1名</span></span></strong><span><span>，中国工程院院士</span></span><strong><span><span>1名</span></span></strong><span><span>，国家级领军人才</span></span><strong><span><span>6名</span></span></strong><span><span>，国家级青年人才</span></span><strong><span><span>10人</span></span></strong><span><span>；广东省高层次人才19人；珠江人才计划创新创业团队2个，深圳市高层次人才87人。</span></span></p></li></ul></section></section><section><section><section><span><span><br/></span></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>柒</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span> 国际交流 </span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>为大力提升学院国际化水平，为学生提供国际优质教育资源，联合培养能够掌握世界科技发展前沿，具有科技创新能力和国际视野的高层次拔尖创新人才，我院已于</span><span>2019年设立学术交流基金：3-5万/人，定期选拔外语水平高、学习成绩优异、综合素质突出的学生赴海外合作高校（如英国曼彻斯特大学、新加坡南洋理工大学等）进行中长期交流，拓展学生的国际视野，提高学生的跨文化交际能力和国际学术竞争力。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><span>近</span><span>5年，为拓展学生科学视野，提升科学素养，学院邀请国内外专家学者400余人次来学院进行学术交流，并举办高水平的学术讲座。过去一年来，学院邀请包括中国科学院孙立成院士，中国科学院张锦院士，加拿大皇家科学院、工程院孙学良院士，中国科学院唐本忠院士，中国科学院李景虹院士等在内的中外教授、学者到访，就各自研究的前沿领域与学院师生互动探讨，反响良好。</span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/icwEjM6J0OibGKHibiaKOJ9ZCm74DXw0xfaUhshD471ZmiaibEY34hJwKvUvESHcic5P22ERjqFnibdQFQkgqv4ibRxZRJGjNSMQpc1lbrJ0DG5tsFk4/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><b><span>捌</span></b></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span> 就业深造 </span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/icwEjM6J0OibEMfnGxiaDjvhmeSnF1bCUlZRjjlSX5yFts5lqUPp35pVztAO5CZLTUtrWWEZ9qq104I8XjPC6IGyE4jYK9QGib7J4reQfK4kic2I/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>我院地处深圳，有良好的就业环境，我院研究生每年就业率均在94%以上，2025年就业率达96.4%。其中有部分同学前往清华大学、北京大学、香港理工大学、香港科技大学等知名高校继续深造；部分同学进入华为、小米、比亚迪、中国石油化工股份有限公司等知名企业就业；部分同学自主创业，已有部分公司产值达到了1000万以上。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>玖</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span> 校园风光 </span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/icwEjM6J0OibELf7sib64ElJ0bcy3Avy0YmcuSspYUFaDfjnTDOrcicAykexADcjOnjB3KeUAFibw7IzrCN5s4tY8FygcuVNTKVyuth4xlJ1SzzU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/icwEjM6J0OibFrMia0JOgMxMGFaqadeibLIJK5EUwXKWW8tVdVeUU7dEWk5fg9yr2xfQe0VX1Slhe6FXibYTOo7TaywDptrG9DEPicibIefa4kxsvs/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/icwEjM6J0OibEwMjClTcborIwQICkDy5MgZm5W9mU4QRzfOrqibHib9BBMcLZv134gqvPTAOFotp28qTw58uA6TlZ7Q0h54sRmPl8EghtmVmdck/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section>